RelStrictConvex:
def RelStrictConvex (Ω : Set V) : Prop :=
  ∀ x ∈ Ω, ∀ y ∈ Ω, x ≠ y → ∀ a b : ℝ, 0 < a → 0 < b → a + b = 1 →
    a • x + b • y ∈ Ω ∧ ¬ IsBoundaryState Ω (a • x + b • y)

eq_one_of_certain_of_not_boundary:
